{"id":"43dc0a00cf0bc7e0","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-pcf4-approachability-ideal-member.md","title":"ZFC Pcf4 Approachability Ideal Member","display":"df-zfc-pcf4-approachability-ideal-member — ZFC Pcf4 Approachability Ideal Member","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf4-approachability-ideal-member","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf4-approachability-ideal-member"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf4-approachability-ideal-member — ZFC Pcf4 Approachability Ideal Member","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-club-subset.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-pcf4-approachable-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf4-approachability-ideal-member"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf4-approachability-ideal-member</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf4-approachability-ideal-member — ZFC Pcf4 Approachability Ideal Member"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a8154e2b2d1118fd\" href=\"?note=a8154e2b2d1118fd\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-club-subset.md\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-club-subset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"098110f8d1f820a5\" href=\"?note=098110f8d1f820a5\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-pcf4-approachable-cardinal.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-pcf4-approachable-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,S,\\vec a,C\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,S,\\vec a,C\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\kappa\">\\(S\\subseteq\\kappa\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec a\\in([\\kappa]^{&lt;\\kappa})^\\kappa\">\\(\\vec a\\in([\\kappa]^{&lt;\\kappa})^\\kappa\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span> (regular-cardinal predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2ClubSubset}_S(C,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2ClubSubset}_S(C,\\kappa)\\)</span> (club-subset predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ApproachableCardinal}_S(\\kappa,\\alpha,\\vec a)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ApproachableCardinal}_S(\\kappa,\\alpha,\\vec a)\\)</span> (approachability predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ApproachabilityIdealMember}_S(\\kappa,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ApproachabilityIdealMember}_S(\\kappa,S)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf4\\text{-}approachability\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}member} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ApproachabilityIdealMember}_S(\\kappa,S)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\\land S\\subseteq\\kappa\\land\\exists\\vec a\\in([\\kappa]^{&lt;\\kappa})^\\kappa\\;\\exists C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2ClubSubset}_S(C,\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\cap C\\;\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ApproachableCardinal}_S(\\kappa,\\alpha,\\vec a)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf4\\text{-}approachability\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}member} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ApproachabilityIdealMember}_S(\\kappa,S)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\\land S\\subseteq\\kappa\\land\\exists\\vec a\\in([\\kappa]^{&lt;\\kappa})^\\kappa\\;\\exists C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2ClubSubset}_S(C,\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\cap C\\;\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ApproachableCardinal}_S(\\kappa,\\alpha,\\vec a)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Membership in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I[\\kappa]\">\\(I[\\kappa]\\)</span> is modulo a club: one sequence witnesses approachability for every point of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\cap C\">\\(S\\cap C\\)</span>. Requiring every point of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> itself to be approachable omitted the nonstationary part of the ideal and was strictly too strong.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-club-subset.md","status":"resolved","id":"a8154e2b2d1118fd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-club-subset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-pcf4-approachable-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"098110f8d1f820a5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-pcf4-approachable-cardinal.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,S,\\vec a,C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec a\\in([\\kappa]^{<\\kappa})^\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2ClubSubset}_S(C,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ApproachableCardinal}_S(\\kappa,\\alpha,\\vec a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ApproachabilityIdealMember}_S(\\kappa,S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf4\\text{-}approachability\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}member} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ApproachabilityIdealMember}_S(\\kappa,S)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\\land S\\subseteq\\kappa\\land\\exists\\vec a\\in([\\kappa]^{<\\kappa})^\\kappa\\;\\exists C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2ClubSubset}_S(C,\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\cap C\\;\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ApproachableCardinal}_S(\\kappa,\\alpha,\\vec a)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"I[\\kappa]","display":false},{"tex":"S\\cap C","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false}],"bytes":1683,"backlinks":[{"id":"eed77950d006550e","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d57975aa190d6476","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ApproachabilityIdealMember}_S$ (approachability-ideal predicate, see [[../batch07/58-df-zfc-pcf4-approachability-ideal-member]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3079","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-pcf4-approachability-ideal-member.md|58-df-zfc-pcf4-approachability-ideal-member]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["0fbfc19800246e77","a8154e2b2d1118fd","098110f8d1f820a5"]}